description:
Add proper lifecycle management for HikariDataSource pools.

Implementation:
1. createPool(String targetUrl, Properties info, Map<String,String> params) method
2. pools.computeIfAbsent() for thread-safe pool creation
3. Shutdown hook for graceful pool cleanup on JVM exit
4. Optional: closePool(String targetUrl) for explicit pool shutdown
5. Handle username/password from Properties

Shutdown hook:
```java
static {
    Runtime.getRuntime().addShutdownHook(new Thread(() -> {
        pools.values().forEach(HikariDataSource::close);
    }));
}
```

Files: src/main/java/org/pjdbc/drivers/HikariPoolDriver.java

Depends on: PJDBC-h03 (configuration must be implemented)
